# JS test tooling (package.json / vitest) is dev-only — the container never
# runs npm. node_modules alone runs ~34 MB; excluding it (not just from git,
# which .gitignore already does — Docker has its own, separate build context)
# is the difference between a fast COPY and needlessly shipping test-runner
# internals into every image build. web/lib/*.mjs (the modules the pages
# actually import at runtime via api/main.py's /lib mount) are NOT excluded.
node_modules
web/lib/*.test.mjs
